Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:54:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/52] settings: AI Command Search delay
 (terminal.input.ai_command_search_debounce_ms)

Dropdown under the '#' toggle (50/200/400/800/1500 ms). Defaults to 400 ms in embedded builds,
where each request costs the user's own API key, and Warp's original 50 ms elsewhere.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
